OL,3,GNEWSADance teacher denies child sexual
OL,4,Aoffences
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dance teacher who featured in a TV
OL,7,Freality series has denied two child sex
OL,8,Foffences.
OL,10,FWarren Bullock, from Lower Penn, near
OL,11,FWolverhampton, spoke only to confirm
OL,12,Fhis personal details and indicate not
OL,13,Fguilty pleas at Cannock Magistrates'
OL,14,FCourt on Friday.
OL,16,FThe 61-year-old is accused of causing
OL,17,For inciting a 14-year-old boy to engage
OL,18,Fin sexual activity and another charge
OL,19,Fof intentionally touching a boy.
